      "id": "claim_255beb4b293d481187d6251a42470beb",
      "statement": "The cash-readiness forecast uses a statistical baseline (ETS + newsvendor Monte-Carlo) behind a swappable ForecastProvider interface, chosen over Prophet/LightGBM because the target-Kỳ observed value is deterministic and the projection horizon is short with near-constant daily amounts.",
