      "id": "claim_b6a11a33115844a689a6f563cb1ba719",
      "statement": "Reliability is gated on resolved-sample count: fewer than 12 observations stay uncalibrated, 12-23 reports learning, 24 or more reports WAPE, bias, interval coverage, and reserve-shortfall rate measured at the same days-to-pay horizon as the live forecast.",
